      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T22:03:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve noted in the documentation that this is only for Android 13. There were concerns about using Android 13 in general as part of the command line parameter\u0027s name for cases where a kernel upgrade happens to a newer version of android, and that kernel would then need to support this feature with android13 in the name, since the bootloader may not be updated.",
      "parentUuid": "eea6e868_db074a2c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2329,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2329,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "365efd0ea14e6d0b1ba0a8071ce20b4faf3e9f01",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e8c3a26b_baed6030",
        "filename": "Documentation/admin-guide/kernel-parameters.txt",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 2329,
      "author": {
        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T22:16:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With regards to updating this for android14, since the ABI is not frozen for those branches, we can instead lower ARCH_DMA_MINALIGN to 64 for arm64, and not have to use this patch.",
      "parentUuid": "fed6d4d1_04562ccc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2329,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2329,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "365efd0ea14e6d0b1ba0a8071ce20b4faf3e9f01",
